Look at this picture. This is a story about a fun swim day.
​There is a big pond of water. The water is brown and grey.
​Look at the people in the water. They are swimming!
Are they cold? No, they are happy. They are having fun in the water.
​Look at the children. Some boys are swimming together.
What are they wearing?
Look closely! Some boys are wearing bright orange life jackets. One boy is wearing a blue life jacket. The life jackets help them float safely in the water.
Are all the jackets blue? No, some jackets are orange and one is blue.
​Look at the back. There is a man. He is smiling. He is watching the children swim.
​Look behind the water. What is that?
There is a big fence made of concrete posts. Behind the fence, there is a very big green field. It is a rice field. The grass is very green. There are also many tall green trees in the back.
​The sky is grey and cloudy. It is a cool afternoon.
​Let's ask some simple questions!
​Are the people playing football?
No, they are not playing football. They are swimming in the water.
​What color are the life jackets?
There are orange life jackets and a blue life jacket.
​Is the field behind the fence red or green?
The field is green. It is a big rice field.
